  jabberITNModal:
    '{{#isFrench}}<div class="jabber-modal-text"><span>IBM déploie présentement un nouveau service téléphonique appelé Jabber. L\'ITN Jabber est le numéro de téléphone interne associé à votre compte Jabber. Pour plus d\'information, consultez notre <a href="https://w3-connections.ibm.com/wikis/home?lang=en#!/wiki/We63202527b16_49af_97f6_08906b36c010/page/BluePages%20-%20FAQ?section=What%20is%20the%20Jabber%20ITN%20number%3F" target="_blank">FAQ.</a></span></div><div class="btn-container"><button class="btn-primary jabber-ok-btn">Ok</button></div>{{/isFrench}}{{^isFrench}}<div class="jabber-modal-text"><span>IBM is rolling out a new telephone service called Jabber. The Jabber ITN is the internal phone number associated with your Jabber account. For more information see our <a href="https://w3-connections.ibm.com/wikis/home?lang=en#!/wiki/We63202527b16_49af_97f6_08906b36c010/page/BluePages%20-%20FAQ?section=What%20is%20the%20Jabber%20ITN%20number%3F" target="_blank">FAQ Item.</a></span></div><div class="btn-container"><button class="btn-primary jabber-ok-btn">Ok</button></div>{{/isFrench}}',
